OL,3,AMajor fire at Canada military base
OL,4,Aleaves four dead, dozens injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour members of the Canadian military
OL,7,Fhave died and dozens were injured at a
OL,8,Fbase in the province of Alberta after a
OL,9,Ffire broke out in a grassy training
OL,10,Farea and spread rapidly due to strong
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,13,FAddressing the nation on Sunday from
OL,14,FOttawa, Prime Minister Mark Carney
OL,15,Fdescribed it as "one of the worst
OL,16,Ftragedies for the forces on Canadian
OL,17,Fsoil in peacetime".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
